1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,050
A file on this computer may not be
available on

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:06,750
another computer. A cloud service stores a
copy under an

3
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:11,590
account. Before switching devices, check
that the latest changes

4
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:15,510
have finished saving or syncing, and
confirm which account owns

5
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:16,750
or controls the file.

6
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:22,100
Choose the smallest permission that lets
the other person do

7
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:27,880
the task. A viewer reads. A commenter can
suggest wording

8
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:31,600
when the service supports comments. An
editor can change the

9
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:35,520
content. Check the recipient carefully,
then ask them to verify

10
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:36,780
that the file opens.

11
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:42,190
Sync carries changes between a device and
an online service.

12
00:00:43,090 --> 00:00:48,410
It may also carry a deletion. That is why
sync

13
00:00:48,410 --> 00:00:51,590
alone is not a separate backup. A backup
is another

14
00:00:51,590 --> 00:00:55,130
recovery copy, and version history may
help you recover earlier

15
00:00:55,130 --> 00:00:57,430
content when the service supports it.

16
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:01,620
If the whole file was deleted, check the
trash or

17
00:01:01,620 --> 00:01:04,560
recycle bin. If the file is still there
but its

18
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:12,140
content changed, inspect version history.
Preview the earlier version

19
00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:15,860
before restoring it, and coordinate with
collaborators so you do

20
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:17,240
not overwrite work they need.

21
00:01:19,050 --> 00:01:22,430
Your classmate should suggest clearer
wording without rewriting

22
00:01:22,430 --> 00:01:26,730
your handout directly. Which permission
fits? Pause and decide.

23
00:01:26,730 --> 00:01:34,310
Commenter access fits when it is
available. Try that choice

24
00:01:34,310 --> 00:01:39,190
in the course simulator, explain your
reason, and keep all practice records
fictional.
